ired various collaborators, including guitarist Jon Klein, with whom he had previously recorded on Siouxsie and .","desc_lfm_artist":"Talvin Singh (Punjabi: ਤਲਵੀਨ ਸਿੰਘ, Sindhi: तालबीन सिन्घ‎) (born 1970 in London, England), is a producer and composer and tabla player, known for creating an innovative fusion of Indian classical music and drum and bass. Singh is generally considered involved with an electronica subgenre called Asian Underground, and more recently as Indian and/or Asian electronica.\n\nAfter collaborating with Siouxsie and the Banshees and Björk in the early 1990s","desc_mb_album":null,"desc_mb_artist":null,"yt_id":"V1ROyUVIeaw","genres":["drum and bass","breakbeat","jungle","electronic"],"rym":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/talvin-singh/ok-1","scaruffi_rating":null,"scaruffi_note":null,"wikipedia_url":null,"aoty_user_score":null,"aoty_critic_score":null,"metacritic_score":null,"label":null},{"n":14,"title":"Philtre","artist":"Nitin Sawhney","year":2005,"mbid":"4cea3dad-19ef-315b-9297-b29b9b49d5cf","heard":false,"cover":"https://coverartarchive.org/release-group/4cea3dad-19ef-315b-9297-b29b9b49d5cf/front-500","spotify_id":null,"spotify_url":null,"desc_lfm_album":null,"desc_lfm_artist":null,"desc_mb_album":null,"desc_mb_artist":null,"yt_id":"2PXEJEBP844","genres":[],"rym":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/nitin-sawhney/philtre","scaruffi_rating":null,"scaruffi_note":null,"wikipedia_url":null,"aoty_user_score":null,"aoty_critic_score":null,"metacritic_score":null,"label":null},{"n":15,"title":"Ha","artist":"Talvin Singh","year":2001,"mbid":"e2c82523-5543-3bee-9981-47ebe66486cd","heard":false,"cover":"https://coverartarchive.org/release-group/e2c82523-5543-3bee-9981-47ebe66486cd/front-500","spotify_id":null,"spotify_url":null,"desc_lfm_album":null,"desc_lfm_artist":null,"desc_mb_album":null,"desc_mb_artist":null,"yt_id":"s37_vcSNOUM","genres":[],"rym":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/talvin-singh/ha","scaruffi_rating":null,"scaruf